{"suttaId":"thag1.51","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[304,307],"vripara":"51"},"segments":{"thag1.51:0.4":"Godhikattheragāthā","thag1.51:1.1":"“Vassati devo yathā sugītaṃ,","thag1.51:1.2":"channā me kuṭikā sukhā nivātā;","thag1.51:1.3":"Cittaṃ susamāhitañca mayhaṃ,","thag1.51:1.4":"atha ce patthayasi pavassa devā”ti.","thag1.51:1.5":"… Godhiko thero …."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":1400,"to":1400,"paras":[{"para":1400,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag1.51:1"],"lines":["Tattha <b>vassatī</b>ti siñcati vuṭṭhidhāraṃ pavecchati.","<b>Devo</b>ti megho.","<b>Yathā sugītan</b>ti sundaragītaṃ viya gajjantoti adhippāyo.","Megho hi vassanakāle satapaṭalasahassapaṭalo uṭṭhahitvā thanayanto vijjutā nicchārentova sobhati, na kevalo.","Tasmā siniddhamadhuragambhīranigghoso vassati devoti dasseti.","Tena saddato anupapīḷitaṃ āha <b>“channā me kuṭikā sukhā nivātā”</b>ti.","Yathā na devo vassati, evaṃ tiṇādīhi chāditā ayaṃ me kuṭikā, tena vuṭṭhivassena anupapīḷitaṃ āha.","Paribhogasukhassa utusappāyautusukhassa ca sabbhāvato sukhā.","Phusitaggaḷapihitavātapānatāhi vātaparissayarahitā.","Ubhayenapi āvāsasappāyavasena anupapīḷitaṃ āha.","<b>Cittaṃ susamāhitañca mayhan</b>ti cittañca mama suṭṭhu samāhitaṃ anuttarasamādhinā nibbānārammaṇe suṭṭhu appitaṃ, etena abbhantaraparissayābhāvato appossukkataṃ dasseti.","<b>Atha ce patthayasī</b>ti atha idāni patthayasi ce, yadi icchasi.","<b>Pavassā</b>ti siñca udakaṃ pagghara vuṭṭhidhāraṃ paveccha.","<b>Devā</b>ti meghaṃ ālapati."],"lineRefs":[["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"],["thag1.51:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag1.51:1.1","vassatī",0,0],["thag1.51:1.1","devo",0,1],["thag1.51:1.3","devo",0,1],["thag1.51:1.1","yathā sugītaṃ",0,2],["thag1.51:1.1","channā me kuṭikā sukhā nivātā",0,5],["thag1.51:1.3","cittaṃ susamāhitañca mayhaṃ",0,10],["thag1.51:1.3","atha ce patthayasī",0,11],["thag1.51:1.3","pavassā",0,12],["thag1.51:1.1","devā",0,13],["thag1.51:1.3","devā",0,13]],"before":[{"para":1346,"vripara":null,"title":"Chaṭṭhavaggo","lines":["Chaṭṭhavaggo"]},{"para":1347,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā"]},{"para":1348,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["<b>Vassati devo</b>tiādikā catasso – godhiko, subāhu, valliyo, uttiyoti imesaṃ catunnaṃ therānaṃ gāthā.","Kā uppatti?","Imepi purimabuddhesu katādhikārā tattha tattha bhave puññāni upacinantā ito catunavute kappe siddhatthassa bhagavato kāle kulagehe nibbattitvā viññutaṃ patvā aññamaññaṃ sahāyā hutvā vicariṃsu.","Tesu eko siddhatthaṃ bhagavantaṃ piṇḍāya carantaṃ disvā kaṭacchubhikkhaṃ adāsi.","Dutiyo pasannacitto hutvā pañcapatiṭṭhitena vanditvā añjaliṃ paggaṇhi.","Tatiyo pasannacitto ekena pupphahatthena bhagavantaṃ pūjesi.","Catuttho sumanapupphehi pūjamakāsi.","Evaṃ te satthari cittaṃ pasādetvā pasutena tena puññakammena devaloke nibbattitvā puna aparāparaṃ puññāni katvā devamanussesu saṃsaranto kassapassa bhagavato kāle kulagehe nibbattitvā sahāyakā hutvā sāsane pabbajitvā samaṇadhammaṃ katvā amhākaṃ bhagavato kāle pāvāyaṃ catunnaṃ mallarājānaṃ puttā hutvā nibbattiṃsu.","Tesaṃ <b>godhiko, subāhu, valliyo, uttiyo</b>ti nāmāni akaṃsu.","Aññamaññaṃ piyasahāyā ahesuṃ.","Te kenacideva karaṇīyena kapilavatthuṃ agamaṃsu.","Tasmiñca samaye satthā kapilavatthuṃ gantvā nigrodhārāme vasanto yamakapāṭihāriyaṃ dassetvā suddhodanappamukhe sakyarājāno damesi.","Tadā tepi cattāro mallarājaputtā pāṭihāriyaṃ disvā laddhappasādā pabbajitvā vipassanākammaṃ karontā nacirasseva saha paṭisambhidāhi arahattaṃ pāpuṇiṃsu.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 1.11.1-23)–"]},{"para":1349,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggahaṃ;"]},{"para":1350,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pavarā abhinikkhantaṃ, vanā nibbanamāgataṃ."]},{"para":1351,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kaṭacchubhikkhaṃ pādāsiṃ, siddhatthassa mahesino;"]},{"para":1352,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Paññāya upasantassa, mahāvīrassa tādino."]},{"para":1353,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Padenānupadāyantaṃ, nibbāpente mahājanaṃ;"]},{"para":1354,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Uḷārā vitti me jātā, buddhe ādiccabandhune."]},{"para":1355,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;"]},{"para":1356,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, bhikkhādānassidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":1357,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sattāsītimhito kappe, mahāreṇusanāmakā;"]},{"para":1358,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sattaratanasampannā, sattete cakkavattino."]},{"para":1359,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti."]},{"para":1360,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Godhiko thero."]},{"para":1361,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ, nisabhājāniyaṃ yathā;"]},{"para":1362,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tidhāpabhinnaṃ mātaṅgaṃ, kuñjaraṃva mahesinaṃ."]},{"para":1363,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Obhāsentaṃ disā sabbā, uḷurājaṃva pūritaṃ;"]},{"para":1364,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Rathiyaṃ paṭipajjantaṃ, lokajeṭṭhaṃ apassahaṃ."]},{"para":1365,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Ñāṇe cittaṃ pasādetvā, paggahetvāna añjaliṃ;"]},{"para":1366,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pasannacitto sumano, siddhatthamabhivādayiṃ."]},{"para":1367,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;"]},{"para":1368,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ñāṇasaññāyidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":1369,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tesattatimhito kappe, soḷasāsuṃ naruttamā;"]},{"para":1370,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sattaratanasampannā, cakkavattī mahabbalā."]},{"para":1371,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti."]},{"para":1372,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Subāhutthero."]},{"para":1373,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tivarāyaṃ nivāsīhaṃ, ahosiṃ māliko tadā;"]},{"para":1374,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, siddhatthaṃ lokapūjitaṃ."]},{"para":1375,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Pasannacitto sumano, pupphahatthamadāsahaṃ;"]},{"para":1376,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Yattha yatthupapajjāmi, tassa kammassa vāhasā."]},{"para":1377,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Anubhomi phalaṃ iṭṭhaṃ, pubbe sukatamattano;"]},{"para":1378,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Parikkhitto sumallehi, pupphadānassidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":1379,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;"]},{"para":1380,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pupphapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":1381,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Catunnavutupādāya, ṭhapetvā vattamānakaṃ;"]},{"para":1382,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pañcarājasatā tattha, najjasamasanāmakā."]},{"para":1383,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti."]},{"para":1384,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Valliyo thero."]},{"para":1385,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Siddhatthassa bhagavato, jātipupphamadāsahaṃ;"]},{"para":1386,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pādesu satta pupphāni, hāsenokiritāni me."]},{"para":1387,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tena kammenahaṃ ajja, abhibhomi narāmare;"]},{"para":1388,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane."]},{"para":1389,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;"]},{"para":1390,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pupphapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":1391,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Samantagandhanāmāsuṃ, terasa cakkavattino;"]},{"para":1392,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Ito pañcamake kappe, cāturantā janādhipā."]},{"para":1393,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti.(apa. thera 1.11.1-23);"]},{"para":1394,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Uttiyo thero."]},{"para":1395,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Arahattaṃ pana patvā ime cattāropi therā loke pākaṭā paññātā rājarājamahāmattehi sakkatā garukatā hutvā araññe saheva viharanti.","Athekadā rājā bimbisāro te cattāro there rājagahaṃ upagate upasaṅkamitvā vanditvā temāsaṃ vassāvāsatthāya nimantetvā tesaṃ pāṭiyekkaṃ kuṭikāyo kāretvā satisammosena na chādesi.","Therā acchannāsu kuṭikāsu viharanti.","Vassakāle devo na vassati.","Rājā “kiṃ nu kho kāraṇaṃ devo na vassatī”ti cintento, taṃ kāraṇaṃ ñatvā, tā kuṭikāyo chādāpetvā, mattikākammaṃ cittakammañca kārāpetvā, kuṭikāmahaṃ karonto mahato bhikkhusaṅghassa dānaṃ adāsi.","Therā rañño anukampāya kuṭikāyo pavisitvā mettāsamāpattiyo samāpajjiṃsu.","Athuttarapācīnadisato mahāmegho uṭṭhahitvā therānaṃ samāpattito vuṭṭhānakkhaṇeyeva vassituṃ ārabhi.","Tesu godhikatthero samāpattito vuṭṭhāya saha meghagajjitena –"]},{"para":1397,"vripara":"51","title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Vassati devo yathā sugītaṃ, channā me kuṭikā sukhā nivātā;"]},{"para":1398,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Cittaṃ susamāhitañca mayhaṃ, atha ce patthayasi pavassa devā”ti.","–"]},{"para":1399,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi."]}],"after":[{"para":1401,"vripara":null,"title":"Godhikādicatuttheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Godhikattheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
